    "body": "`CreateNewBlock_validity` mines a 110-block chain and then runs four subtests on it as member functions. The subtests share one chain, so each starts from whatever the previous one left behind, and the caller has to patch `Tip()->nHeight` between them. Inside `TestBasicMining` a single `CMutableTransaction` is reused across all sections, with each section overwriting some of its fields, so the transaction a section actually tests depends on every section before it.\n\nThis PR removes both kinds of hidden state.",
